## Folded away
This section is hidden, tap its arrow to get it back.
Line numbers stay the same.

## Try it
- Pinch until the lines wrap again
- Tap a warning to read it
- Tap the left edge to set a bookmark
- Tap an arrow to fold a section

## Shorter lines
Tap a box to see what it hides, move the cursor away to hide it again.
Read the [KodeHighlighter docs](https://github.com/markusressel/KodeHighlighter/blob/master/README.md#usage) or look at ![a tiny image](data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAYAAAAfFcSJAAAADUlEQVR42mNk+M/wHwAEBgIApD5fRAAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==) in the middle of a sentence.
Plain addresses get shorter too: https://github.com/markusressel/KodeEditor/pull/140/files?diff=split
